						CASE 3
							PRINTFORMDL A shimmering rift opens to YuugenMagan's right.
							PRINTFORMDW Without saying a word or even turning her head, YuugenMagan hurls the bottle through it. It closes a few seconds later.
					ENDSELECT
				CASE 2
